			}
		},
		QuestName = "The Device That Chose You 1",
		Quest = "<font color=\"rgb(0,255,0)\">You belong to the Index now.</font> Restore the Caduceus: the <font color=\"rgb(32,177,255)\">Alloy</font> falls only rarely from Extreme bosses of the twenty-thousandth level or higher -- fewer than one corpse in a hundred yields it; the <font color=\"rgb(32,177,255)\">Ink</font> is bled from ten Extreme bosses of the twenty-thousandth level or higher, and it scatters the moment you fall; the <font color=\"rgb(32,177,255)\">Core</font> waits past five dungeons, or twenty floors up the Tower.",
